- Use directory handle to list all *.mp3 or *.mp4 files that have a matching *.txt
  and put them into the GUI: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FileSystemDirectoryHandle
- Song key display
- Semitone pitch adjustment during playback (adjust key)

Chord / lyrics demo

- Show sheet music or piano roll for vocals
- Show sheet music, piano roll, or tab for guitar
- Show blow pattern harmonica
- Show fingering for clarinet
- Show chord fingering/voicing for guitar
- Strumming motion for chords instead of bouncing ball (big/little down triangle, big/little up triangle, open circle, X)
- Horizontal scrolling mode (everything scrolls in from right)
- Singer: show vocal trainer
- Guitarist: show rhythm, solo, or lead trainer
- Drop into rhythm trainer / jam
